# Website screens

Website screens are HTML canvases inside the desktop frame.

- Keep `data-feature-canvas` equal to the screen id (`print-config`, `dosage-library`, `pos-index`)
- Shared Pulse CSS/helpers live in `pos/shared/`
- Bind the active canvas from `pos/index.js`
- Do not move layout back into JavaScript template strings
